OL,3,GNEWSAFour jailed for death of man
OL,4,Atortured and set alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fthat readers may find distressing
OL,9,FFour men have been jailed for killing a
OL,10,Fmember of an organised crime group who
OL,11,Fwas tortured, doused in petrol and set
OL,12,Falight.
OL,14,FFather-of-two Tomasz Samel, 45, was
OL,15,Fkidnapped in March 2019 in Birmingham
OL,16,Fby three men claiming to be from
OL,17,FInterpol, before being driven to the
OL,18,FLiverpool area and attacked over the
OL,19,Floss of illicit cigarettes worth #1m.
